    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="71">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 71</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CXV} Gif mon sie wertyhtlan betogen ⁊ he hit þonne geondette beforan aðe ⁊ onsace ǽr, bide mon mid þære witerædenne, oð ðæt se wer gegolden sie.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person is accused of an act for which wergild must be paid and then confesses on oath but has denied it previously, one should wait to collect the fine until the wer has been paid.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man is accused on a charge involving the payment of wergeld, and [if], when he is required to give an oath, he confesses the act, which he has previously denied, no proceedings shall be taken to secure the fine until the wergeld has been paid.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon sy wertyhtlan betogen ⁊ he hit þonne geondette beforan aþe ⁊ onsace ær, abide man mid ðære witerædene, oð þæt se wer gegolden sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
